  "summary": "Final cell C21 reads the 60x60 region block, computes per-cell day-of-year Hazen 90th percentiles over \u00b15-day pools from 1991-12-27..2003-01-05, smooths with a cumsum-based wrapped 31-day mean (whose cumulative sums make each selected target doy 153-244 arithmetically depend on raw threshold doys 1-259 and the wrapped doys 352-366, i.e. pool dates Dec 27..Sep 20 and Dec 12..Jan 5 of each year), and compares every 2012-06-01..08-31 SST of every sea cell to the threshold before run detection and writing mhw_mask.nc. Edge values 1991-12-27..31 and 2003-01-01..05 also reach the mask but fall outside the reported years."
